is not independent proof of reliability, safety, accuracy, cost, or

145
00:07:38.707 --> 00:07:41.893
business results. Product capabilities, permissions, plan availability, retention settings, model

146
00:07:41.893 --> 00:07:45.078
behavior, and policies can change; verify current first-party evidence before

147
00:07:45.078 --> 00:07:48.264
relying on them. This article is educational and is not

148
